    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, we utilize encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest with AES-256, with key management handled through we EU-only infrastructure. we also implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, pseudonymisation is used where relevant, and we adhere to data minimization principles. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides a SecNumCloud compliant layer, ensuring sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU-only." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For auditability and explainability, we product Atelier supports internal quality control and statutory audit review. our product Atelier also maintains an audit log, allows for retrieval trace, and figure source linking, ensuring that all outputs are grounded in sources and can be traced back." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we have no ungrounded numeric output." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the reliability and traceability of our solution's outputs, we will leverage we existing secure software development life cycle (SDLC) practices, including code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. we vulnerability management process includes remediation SLAs by severity, and we have an incident response plan in place that covers detection, notification, and remediation, including adherence to the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, and we ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension, we are well-equipped to handle the confidentiality and security requirements of client data. we Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointment and maintenance of a data processing register, along with having a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available that aligns with GDPR Article 28, further reinforce we commitment to GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we existing measures provide a robust foundation for meeting The tender security, confidentiality, and explainability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict GDPR compliance, respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality, auditor independence, and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client must also comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents and anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with all regulatory requirements outlined in the tender? we have experience with private consultation terms including confidentiality undertakings and are familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy. we is also maintained with a Security & Compliance function that monitors obligations such as GDPR, professional secrecy, anti-money-laundering framework, auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, and legal retention obligations for accounting documents.  we are compliant with the regulatory requirements outlined as we ensure we contractual framework does not place we in a position that could compromise we professional obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag potential risks related to data protection and confidentiality breaches, ensuring we GDPR compliance measures including Article 28 processing agreements are in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we must ensure strict adherence to auditor independence and separation of duties rules to avoid any conflicts of interest.  we professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim provides a level of security, but it is essential to maintain vigilance regarding Our professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim to mitigate potential risks. we can provide administrative attestations, including those related to we compliance with social and fiscal obligations, which could be relevant in addressing the client's demands for strict regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocated to the project is €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled, and as an SME, the titleholder must propose a cost-optimised approach while guaranteeing expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimisation strategies can our propose? our budget envelope for the project is €220,000 over 3 years, with 40% allocated to one-off project costs in the first year and 60% to recurring run costs over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To maintain a healthy margin, our target gross margin range is between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within our normal deal range and financial capacity, our can propose a cost-optimised approach by favouring cost-efficient tiers and models that protect the gross margin and the predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model is noted as the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By opting for The sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, our can aim to achieve a gross margin within our target range while ensuring an acceptable quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for the projected margin, without specific details on the exact costs associated with each component of the project, it's challenging to provide a precise figure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, by maintaining a disciplined approach to cost management and through careful selection of cost-efficient options where requirements allow, our can work towards achieving a gross margin that falls within our target range of 25% to 35%.  work would involve close collaboration with the architect to ensure the chosen configuration stays within the SME envelope while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, maintaining a three-year cost model that can be re-run if requirements or budget change will help in adjusting strategies as needed to optimize costs and protect margins." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires intelligent assistance for information retrieval, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and collaboration between professionals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our AI capabilities support these needs while ensuring explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs, and what innovation strategies can our propose to enhance the quality of service? our AI capabilities at Faber IA, grounded in retrieval-augmented generation, can support intelligent assistance for information retrieval, drafting professional documents, handling client files, and collaboration between professionals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The core approach of our Atelier platform ensures that every answer is generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, providing transparency and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the needs of information retrieval, our hybrid retrieval capabilities combining lexical and semantic approaches can efficiently locate relevant information within the client's controlled corpus." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting professional documents, template-guided drafting allows for the creation of structured and coherent texts such as client letters, mission notes, and file syntheses, all grounded in validated material to ensure reliability. our Atelier platform ability to perform multi-document synthesis and structured extraction with source linking enhances handling of client files by synthesizing information from multiple sources and extracting key figures or data points while linking key figures or data points back to key figures or data points original source passages." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

